I was thinking in the realm of changing

https://github.com/facebook/react/blob/f56dfe950b206651913bf0b836c10592c393357d/packages/react-devtools-shared/src/hook.js#L293-L294

to something like

```js
            if (color) {
              if (typeof args[0] === 'string') {
                originalMethod(`%c${format(...args)}`, `color: ${color}`);
              } else {
                originalMethod(...args);
              }
```
